{"id":"n50949-1-7","stage":3,"title":"드라이어 · 吹风机","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50949-1-7-1","ko":"너 오늘 머리 안 말리고 그냥 나왔어?","zh":"你今天没弄干头发就出来了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말리고","meaning":"劝，劝解","explanation":"말리다：劝，劝解；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말리다","audio":"/audio/887a3759846ff90f5fc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14628","senseId":"1","lemma":"말리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔어?","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈